Here are some nethack bug fixes I've attempted to mail to
genat!mike with no luck.  The first two I poste awhile ago.


8/85

Change "+" into '+' in case 6 of the gods being pleased.

Currently, if a dog is leashed and the leash is dropped, the dog
is still leashed.  The code can be added to drop(obj) in do.c:

#ifedf WALKIES	
	if (obj->otyp == LEASH) {
	    register struct monst *mtmp = fmon;
	    while (mtmp && !mtmp->mleashed) mtmp = mtmp->nmon;
	    if (mtmp) {
		pline ("Your leash is tied around your hand.");
		return (0);
	    }
	}
#endif

